    <summary>
            Azure data factory nested object which contains information about creating
            pipeline run             Please note
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.DataFactoryTriggerProperties is
            the base class. According to the scenario, a derived class of the base
            class might need to be assigned here, or this property needs to be casted
            to one of the possible derived classes.             The available derived
            classes include
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.DataFactoryBlobEventsTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.DataFactoryBlobTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.ChainingTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.CustomEventsTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.MultiplePipelineTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.RerunTumblingWindowTrigger,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.DataFactoryScheduleTrigger and
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.TumblingWindowTrigger.
            </summary>
